  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Enumerates values that control the layout direction for views.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            The default value for an element without a parent is <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.FlowDirection.LeftToRight" />, even on platforms with right-to-left device defaults.
            To opt in to right-to-left layout, set the root element's <c>FlowDirection</c> property to <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.FlowDirection.RightToLeft" />, or use <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.FlowDirection.MatchParent" /> to follow the device.
            All elements with a parent default to <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.FlowDirection.MatchParent" />.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
